<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">NZABUKUSU YI YOANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nza</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nzabukusu yi Yoane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Nzabukusu wu Yoane</para>
  <para style="mt1">Buuku di Nzabukusu yi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yoane</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wuu ni mukanda wusonika Yoane, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto. Wuna ta ti misamu mimvimba mi kasonika, ni mi kayena mu meso mandi, mi kayuwa mu makutu mandi. Wuna ta dyaka ti ni Mpeve Nzambi yi mulwata, mwanki kazaba mimvimba mi kayena.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakanga Yoane mu kwe mu sisa ku kizanga ki bakwe tumisinanga Patamose, ku kizunga ki Aziya. Ni hahoho, kasonikina mukanda bewuwu mu syamisa kizingu ki Minkwikisi, mu dyambu ti ntangu yi ba koko yi babakwamisa. Ni hahoho kabateela bakangama nakekete natee mu kilumbu ki nsukunu, mu kwikila, mu dyambu ti Yesu wuta: «Ku yondowo nungini, naamuhaana kadya mbutu zi muti wu luzingu, wudi ku mazulu mu lumbu di Nzambi.» (Nzabukusu yi Yoane 2.7). Mpe Yesu yandi bende waakwiza mu muswalu, mu bedisa mambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Misamu emi mii mfunu mu buuku bedidi: Wuntete mpeve zimbi zina sala ha butoto bebubu, na Minkwikisi baayena mpasi natee bahiika ha kati dyawu baabahonda. Wunzole, Yesu-Klisto wudi Mfumu, na waabedisa bantu bamvimba babisidi Nzambi, bumosi mpe mpeve zimbi zimvimba. Wutatu, Nzambi wukubika musendo ku bantu bamukwikidi, nsungula yobobo babahonda mu dyambu dyandi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mpova zii sonama mu buuku bedidi lulendo zidi, na zina syamisa bantu bebobo batoma yena mpasi. Zina balonka ti mpeleko bisi-Loma ba bayenisa mpasi, kansi Mwana Dimeme di Nzambi waakatula zo, mu dyambu ti yandi waababedisa. Ni zazozo za basyamisa bubwingi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Misamu mi bazabikisa ku Yoane, bonso bwa zimbidila butoto, bima bimoona Nzambi bi kaatuula na bwedi kaavuukisila yobobo ba mu tumimini, Yoane myaakata. Satana, na mbazi zandi, na yobobo bamvimba bamutumimina, Yesu waababedisa na waabalosa mu bulu di nsisi. Mazulu mamoona maaba, bumosi mpe butoto bumoona, mbanza yimoona, mpe Nzambi na Mfumu Yesu baakwiza zakala na bantu bamutumimini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tala bonso budi ndandani yi misamu mu buuku bedidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:1-8">1.1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Yesu wu kiyenikisa ku Yoane ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:9-20">1.9-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Mikanda ku minkwikisi ku mbanza nsambwadi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2:1-3:22">2.1–3.22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Nzitusu ku mazulu ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 4:1-11">4.1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Buuku diba dikangama mu misinga nsambwadi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 5:1-6:17">5.1–6.17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Nzitusu ha ntadisi yi kyandu kintinu ki Nzambi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 7:1-17">7.1-17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Masiki nsambwadi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 8:1-11:19">8.1–11.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Ndalango na bibulu byole ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12:1-13:18">12.1–13.18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">9) Mfundusu yi bantu na yi yobobo babakudidi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 14:1-15:8">14.1–15.8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">10) Mbungu zi nganzi zi Nzambi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 16:1-21">16.1-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">11) Mitantu mi Nzambi myaabedoso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 17:1-20:10">17.1–20.10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">12) Mfundusu yi mansukina ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 20:11-15">20.11-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">13) Yulu dimoona na butoto bumoona ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:1-8">21.1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">14) Yelusalemi yimoona ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:9-22:5">21.9–22.5</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">15) Klisto waakwiza mu muswalu ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 22:6-21">22.6-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bandukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Buuku bedidi dina zabikisa misamu miba miswama, Nzambi mi kahaana ku Yesu-Klisto, mwanki kalonka ku mindongo myandi misamu myatuula mu mwa ntangu yifyoti. Klisto wutambika mbazi andi ku mundongo andi Yoane mu muzabikisa myo. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Yoane wuteedi kimbangi mu misamu mimvimba mi kayeni: ni Mambu ma Nzambi na kikedika kizabukusu mu nzila yi Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Kyese ku yondowo tengi buuku bedidi, kyese ku yobobo bayudi mpova zi mbikudulu beyiyi na bakebidi bumbote misamu mibasonikini momo! Mu dyambu ti ntangu yikubuku misamu mimvimba bemyomyo yeka bela-bela mu tula.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimbote ku mabundu nsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Meno Yoane nsonikini ku mabundu nsambwadi maa ku kizunga ki Aziya: bika Nzambi wudi, wuba na wuna kwiza na zimpeve nsambwadi zidi ha ntadisi yi kyandu kyandi ki kintinu, baluhaana lusakumunu na kiyenge. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Bika Yesu-Klisto, mbangi yikwikama, muntu wuntete wubutuka na wufuluka mu bafwa, mpe yandi wudi mfumu yi zintinu zii ha luse lu butoto, kaluhaana lusakumunu na kiyenge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Klisto wututiidi, mpe mu menga mandi, wutukuula mu masumu meto, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />mpe wutusa bantu ba kimfumu ki zinganga-Nzambi mu sadila Nzambi Tata andi. Bika nkembo na lulendo lusikila ku yandi mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Taleeno, wuna kwiza mu matuti! Bantu bamvimba baamuyena, na yobobo mpe bamutobola lubanzi. Bantu ba bifumba bimvimba bii ha luse lu butoto, baadila mu dyambu dyandi. Ninga, bwabobo bwaabeela!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Mfumu Nzambi wuna ta ti: «Meno nidi alafa na omega», yondowo wudi, wuba na wuna kwiza, ni Mfumu wuu na lulendo lumvimba.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbweno yi Yoane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Meno Yoane, mpangi eno, nii kintwadi neeno mu kati di mfyetokoso, mu kimfumu na mu mvibudulumu mu Yesu. Naba ku kizanga kii nkumbu Patamose mu dyambu di Mambu ma Nzambi na kimbangi mu Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mu kilumbu ki Mfumu, Mpeve bu yimbaka, nayuwa ku manima mani, ndinga yingolo bonso muningu wu kulumenta, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />yita ti :«Misamu mi wuna yena, sonika myo mu buuku, mpe tambika dyo ku mabundu nsambwadi ema: Efeso, Similine, Pelengame, Tiyatili, Saledesi, Filadelefi na Lawodise.»<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ni natala ku manima mu yena yondowo wedi nzonzila. Ni nayena bitentokolo nsambwadi bi minda bi wola. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Mpe ha kati-kati di bitentokolo bi minda, haba na muntu wedi fwanakana bonso mwana muntu. Wuba wulwata zwele didila na melika yi wola yikangama ha ntulu. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Milengi myandi miba bonso mika mi dimeme dimpembe, hoti bonso mvula zii na vekoveko, mpe meso mandi medi lezima bonso milaka mi tiya, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />malu mandi medi lezima bonso kisengo ki baduukisi ku tiya, mpe ndinga andi yedi yuwakana bonso mamba mamanene ma ntadi mana bwa. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Wuba wusimba mbwetete nsambwadi mu kooko kwandi ku lubakala, mpe mu munwa andi, mwedi duuka mbele yimosi yiyila yilwenga, yiba meeno mu ndambu ka ndambu. Kini kyandi kyedi lezima bonso ntangu ha mbata. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Bu namuyena, nina bwa ha malu mandi bonso muntu wufwa. Wuntentika kooko kwandi ku lubakala na wuta ti: «Kuyenandi bunkuta ko! Meno ni wuntete na wumanunu, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />wumoyo nidi. Naba wufwa, kansi bwabu nidi wumoyo mimvu ka mimvu. Nidi na lulendo mu lufwa na mu nsi yi bafwa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Sonika bwabu misamu mi wuyeni, mina hyoka bubedidi na mina kwiza ku manima. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Mu myo mitadidi mansweki ma mbwetete nsambwadi zi wuyeni mu kooko kwani ku lubakala na bitentokolo nsambwadi bi minda mi wola: mbwetete nsambwadi ni zimbazi zi Mabundu nsambwadi, mpe bitentokolo nsambwadi bi minda ni Mabundu nsambwadi.»<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Efeso: “Yondowo simbidi mbwetete nsambwadi mu kooko kwandi ku lubakala, wuna kwe dyati ha kati di bitentokolo nsambwadi bi minda bi wola, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Nzebi nsadulu aku, mpasi zaku na mvibudulu aku. Nzebi ti kwe vibidilanga bantu baa na mbalu ko. Wutontidi yobobo bakwe tanga ti zintumwa badi, kansi badi awu bo ko, mpe bakudi ti bantu ba luvunu kwandi badi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Mvibudulu zii naku, mpasi zizingi yeni mu dyambu di nkumbu ani, mpe bebidi ko. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Kansi, musamu wu naani nina kusembila, mu dyambu ti wulosidi luzolo lwaku luntete. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Bambuka moyo hedi wubwididi, viluka mpe sadila nsadulu zaku zintete. Tala ti vilukidi ko, mbo niza ku ngeye, mbo nakukatula kitentokolo ki mwinda aku ha kibuka kyandi. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Kansi dyambu dimbote di nina kutondila, bu wubedidi nsadulu zi bantu ba kimvuka ki Nikolayite bonso meno mpe bu na bedidi zo.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu! Ku yondowo nungini, naamuhaana kadya mbutu zi muti wu luzingu, wudi mu paladiso di Nzambi.”»<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di mbanza yi Similine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Similine: “Muntu wuntete na wumanunu, yondowo wufwa na wufuluka mu bafwa, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Nzebi mpasi zaku na bumputu bwaku, nsyongono mvwama wudi. Nzebi bituku bimbalu bikwe kutukanga bahiika. Bakwe tanga ti Bayudayo badi, kansi badi awu bo ko: kimvuka ki Satana badi! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Kuyenandi bunkuta mu misamu bemyomyo mi waayenina mpasi ko. Tala, ha kati dyeno nkadyampemba waalutonta bu kaatuba babingi mu boloko. Mu bilumbu kumi baalukwamisa. Ba wukwikama natee lufwa, mbo nakuhaana luzingu bonso mpu yi ndungunu.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu! Ku yondowo nungini, kaayena bunkuta bu lufwa lunzole ko.”»<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di mbanza yi Pelengame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Pelengame: “Yondowo wuu na mbele yiyila yilwenga, yii meeno mu ndambu ka ndambu, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Nzebi kwedi kwe zakidilanga: kokoko kuu kyandu ki kintinu ki Satana. Ngeye wukangama nakekete wudi mu nkumbu ani. Wunyafuni kiminu kyani ko, kaati mu ntangu yi bahonda ku kweno, Antipase mbangi ani yikwikama, kokoko kukwe zakidilanga Satana! <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Kansi, mwa ndambu yi misamu mimbi nina kusembila: mu dyambu ti ku kwaku, wuu na bantu badi bakangama mu ndongosolo yi Balami. Yondowo wuhaana mayindu ku Balaki mu tambila bisi-Isaeli mutambu, mwanki badya mbizi zi bibulu bibahaana munkayulu ku biteki na basadila kindumba. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Bumosi mpe, kudi dyaka na bantu bakangama mu ndongosolo yi kimvuka ki Nikolayite. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Ni hahoho, viluka bwabu. Nganunu, mbo niza mu nswalu ku ngeye mpe mbo nanwanisa bantu bebobo mu mbele yiyila, yina duuka mu munwa ani.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu! Ku yondowo nungini, naahaana maana maa maswama. Naahaana dyaka mpe tadi dimpembe dibasonikini ha yulu nkumbu yimoona, yilembolo zabu ku muntu, tala ti ka yondowo tambudi yo ko.”»<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di ku mbanza yi Tyatile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Tiyatili: “Mwana wu Nzambi, yondowo wuu na meso mana lezima bonso milaka mi tiya, mpe wuu na malu bonso kisengo kibaduukisi ku tiya, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Nzebi nsadulu zaku, luzolo lwaku, kiminu kyaku, mpeve aku yi nsalasani, mvibudulu aku. Nzebi ti nsadulu zaku zi bubedidi zivudidi bubwingi na zintete. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Kansi, misamu mii naani nina kusembila: wubikidi Yezabeli kahidika mi katiidi. Mukento bewowo wuna kibika mu mbikudi wu Nzambi, kansi wuna huna bisadi byani, mu bahukumuna mu ndongosolo yi luvunu mwanki badya mbizi zi bibulu bibahaana bonso munkayulu ku biteki. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Namuheeni ntangu mwanki kaviluka, kansi bisidi kwandi mu bika kindumba. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ni hahoho, nina mulambikisa ha mbuka yi mpasi zihyokidi kitezo, ha kimosi na yobobo bakwe sadilanga kinsuza nandi, tala ti babisidi nsadulu zandi ko. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mpe naahondisa baala bandi. Bwabobo mabundu mamvimba maazabila ti meno ni yondowo kwe fimpanga misamu mii ku nsye mutima na kwe bakulanga mabanza ma bantu. Mbo nasenda kadi muntu bonso budi mavanga mandi.”<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Ku yeeno bantu ba dibundu di ku mbanza yi Tiyatili, lulembolo kangama mu ndongosolo beyoyo, mpe lulongoka misamu bemyomyo ko mi bakwe tumisinanga ti “Mansweki mampinda ma Satana”, ebu nina luteela: nalukwikidi kizitu kihiika ko. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Kansi, kangameeno nakekete mu ndongosolo zi lutambudi natee bu naavutuka.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Ku yondowo nungini, mpe wuna landa bumbote nsadulu zani natee ku nsukunu, mbo namuhaana lulendo mu yaala zinsi.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Waabatwadisa mu kibakala na muhangu wu kimfumu wu kisengo mpe waababula bonso bu bakwe budilanga masanga ma tubumba, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />bonso mebende natambudi lulendo belolo ku Tata ani. Mpe naamuhaana lubwetete lu mene.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu!»<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di mbanza yi Saledesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii mbanza yi Saledesi: “Yondowo wuu na mpeve nsambwadi zi Nzambi na mbwetete nsambwadi, ebu kateedi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">Nzebi nsadulu zaku, mpe nzebi ti kikumu kyaku kimwangana ti wumoyo wudi, nsyongono wufwa kwaku wudi. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Kaya meso na syamisa yobobo basidi beka lukufi mu fwa. Mu dyambu ti nyeni nsadulu zaku zidi zilunga ko ha ntadisi yi Nzambi ani. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Bambuka moyo bwedi wutambudila na wuyuwila Mambu ma Nzambi. Keba mo na viluka. Tala ti wuna kaya meso ko, mbo niza bonso mwivi, mpe waazaba ko nkye ntangu naakwiza kubatikisa. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Kansi, mwa ndambu yi bantu baku baa mu dibundu di mbanza yi Saledesi balembolo sumuna binkutu byawu. Baadyata ha kimosi naani na baalwata binkutu bimpembe, mu dyambu ti yawu bafwanakana (balunga) badi.<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Yondowo wunungini, waalwata binkutu bimpembe. Naakatula nkumbu andi mu mukanda wumoyo ko. Mbo namuzaba ha ntadisi yi Tata ani na zimbazi zandi.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di ku mbanza yi Filadelefi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Filadelefi : “Wulongo, Wukedika, yondowo wuu na nsabi yi ntinu Davidi, tala ti zibudi, kuu na muntu ko wulenda kanga, mpe tala ti kengi, kuu na muntu ko wulenda zibula, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Nzebi nsadulu zaku. Tala, nzibudi ha ntadisi aku mwelo, kuu muntu ko wulenda kanga wo, mu dyambu ti wuu na lulendo lu lwingi ko, mpe wukebidi Mambu mani na wunyafuni nkumbu ani ko. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Tala, nina kuhaana bantu baa mu kimvuka ki Satana, yobobo bakwe tanga ti yawu Bayudayo badi, kansi badi awu bo ko. Kuhuna kwawu bana sa. Tala, mbo nasa ti biza bafukama ha malu maku, na bazaba ti meno nakutiidi. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Mu dyambu ti wukebidi Mambu mani mamvibudulu, meno mpe naakukeba mu ntangu yi ntontolo zina kwiza mu nza yimvimba, mu tonta bantu ba ha luse lu butoto. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi, nina kwiza. Kangama nakekete mu byo bii naku, mwanki nakani muntu kabongandi mpu aku yi nungunu.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Ku muntu bewowo nungini, mbo namukitula kunzi mu kati di nzo-Nzambi ani, mpe kabwesa duuka dyaka ku mbazi ko. Mbo nasonika nkumbu yi Nzambi ani, yoyoyo yi mbanza yi Nzambi ani mpe na nkumbu ani yimoona mu yondowo waanunga. Nkumbu yi mbanza beyoyo, ni Yelusalemi yimoona yifumini ku yulu, ku Nzambi ani.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda ku dibundu di mbanza yi Lawodise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />«Sonika ku mbazi yi dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Lawodise: “Yondowo wu bakwe tumisinanga Ameni, mbangi yikwikama na yikedika, wudi mbadukulu yi bima bimvimba bihiidika Nzambi, ebu kateedi: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Nzebi nsadulu zaku. Nzebi bumbote ti wudi kyozi ko na wudi tiya ko. Tala ti wuba kwandi kyozi hoti tiya! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Kansi mu dyambu ti nalalangani wudi, wudi kyozi ko na wudi tiya ko. Ni bwabobo naakulukila. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ngeye wuna ta ti: Mvwama nidi, nakivwamisi, mpe nii na nsatu yi kima ko.” Kansi zebi ko ti mu mpasi na mu kyadi wudi! Mputu, mpene na mpofo wudi. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ni hahoho, nina kuhaana malongi wusumba ku meno wola disukulu ku tiya, mwanki wukituka nkatika mvwama. Sumba mpe binkutu bimpembe mu lwata na mu lembolo yena nsoni yi mpene. Sumba mpe bilongo bi wasadisila meso, mwanki wuyena. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Meno nakwe baminanga mpe nakwe sembanga bamvimba bebobo ba natiidi. Bwabu, fweti ba na vema, mpe viluka. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Tala, meno ntelamani ha mwelo mpe nkonkoti. Tala ti muntu yudi ndinga ani na zibudi mwelo, nina kota mu nzo andi, nina dya ha kimosi nandi mpe yandi na meno.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Ku muntu bewowo nungini, mbo namuhaana luve lwe zakala naani ha kyandu ki kintinu kyani, bonso mebende bu nanunga na bu nazakadi na Tata ani ha kyandu ki kintinu kyandi.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Yondowo wuu na makutu, kayuwa misamu bemyomyo mina ta Mpeve ku mabundu!»<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nsambudulu yi mazulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, nina yena ku yulu, mwelo wumosi wuzibuka. Ndinga yintete yi nayuwa yedi zonza naani, yitendana bonso muningu wu kulumenta yita ti: «Maka eha, na mbo nakulonka misamu bemyomyo myaakwiza ku manima.»<verse eid="REV 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Hansi na nsi, Mpeve yimbaka. Ni nayena ku yulu, kyandu ki kintinu kimosi. Ha yulu kyandu ki kintinu bekyokyo, muntu wumosi wuba wuzakala, <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />wedi lezima bonso matadi mantalu ma bakwe tumisinanga ti zasipi na saladwani. Mpe mukyama wuzungidila kyandu ki kintinu, wedi lezima bonso tadi di bakwe tumisinanga ti emelode. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kyandu ki kintinu kiba kizungudulu ku byandu bi kintinu makumole na ya (24), mpe makumole na ya (24) ma binunu biba bizakala momo. Bilwata binkutu bimpembe na zimpu zi kintinu zi wola. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ha kyandu ki kintinu, hedi duukanga mpedamu, zindinga na mimbamina. Hantadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu, minda nsambwadi mi milaka mi tiya myedi hyanga: midi ni mpeve nsambwadi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Hantadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu, haba bonso mubu wuu nakyenzikyenzi wufwanakana na tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima. Ha kati-kati di kyandu ki kintinu na mu kinzungudila ki kyandu ki kintinu, haba na bihangu biya bimoyo, biba bifuluka mu meso ku mutwala na ku manima.<verse eid="REV 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Kihangu kintete kimoyo kifwanakana na nkosi, kinzole kifwanakana na ngombe yintwenya yimbakala, kitatu kiba na kiini kifwanakana na muntu, mpe kiya kifwanakana na mbemba yina kwe pidumuki mu yulu. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Kimosi-kimosi mu bihangu biya bebyobyo bimoyo, biba na mahahi masambanu mafuluka mu meso ku kati na ku mbazi, mpe mpimpa na mwini bitatamana mu ta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">«Wulongo, Wulongo, Wulongo Mfumu, Nzambi wuu na lulendo lumvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">yondowo wuba, wudi na wuna kwiza.»<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Bihangu biya bimoyo bebyobyo bu byaahaana nkembo na masiika, mpe kuvutula matondo ku yondowo zakadi ha kyandu ki kintinu, ku yondowo wuna zinga mimvu ka mimvu, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />zinkuluntu makumole na ziya zaafukama ha ntadisi yi yondowo zakadi ha kyandu ki kintinu, zaadongimina yondowo wuna zinga mimvu ka mimvu, mpe bu zaalosa zimpu zawu zi kintinu ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu, mbo zita ti:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />«Ngeye Mfumu eto na Nzambi eto, wulunga wudi mu tambula nkembo, masiika na lulendo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Mu dyambu ti ngeye wuhidika bima bimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">mu luzolo lwaku ni biba, mpe ni bihiduku.»<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Buuku dikangama di Mwana Dimeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Mboki nayena mu kooko ku lubakala ku yondowo wuba wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu, buuku diba dizingama disonama ku kati na ku manima, dikangama mu misinga nsambwadi. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Mpe nayena mbazi yimosi yilulendo yedi zonza mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Nani wudi wulunga mu zibula buuku na mu nyanguna misinga e?»<verse eid="REV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kansi kunaani muntu, ku yulu, ha luse lu butoto mpe ku nsye butoto, wulenda zibula buuku na wulenda tala bii ku kati. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nadila bubwingi mu dyambu ti kuba na muntu ko wulunga mu zibula buuku na mu tala bii ku kati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Buna, wumosi mu zinkuluntu wunteela ti: «Tala, kudilandi, nkosi yii mu kifumba ki Yuda, yondowo wuu mu nkuna yi ntinu Davidi, nungini. Yandi lenda nyanguna misinga nsambwadi na lenda zibula buuku.»<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Mboki nayena ha kati di kyandu ki kintinu na bihangu biya bimoyo ha kati di zinkuluntu, Mwana Dimeme wutelama wuba bonso munkayulu we yoka. Wuba na masiki nsambwadi na meso nsambwadi. Meso bemomo ni mpeve nsambwadi zi Nzambi zifidusu mu nza yimvimba. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mwana dimeme wuyiza na wutambula buuku mu kooko ku lubakala ku yondowo wuba wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Bu katambula buuku, bihangu biya bebyobyo bimoyo na makumole na ya ma zinkuluntu bafukama ha ntadisi yi Mwana Dimeme, mpe wumosi-wumosi wusimba kisanzi kimosi na mbungu zi wola zifuluka mu maaka mamfuku yimbote, ni zinsambulu zi balongo. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Bayimbila mukunga wumosi wumoona ewu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">« Wulunga wudi mu tambula buuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">mpe mu nyanguna misinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">mu dyambu ti wuhaanu bonso munkayulu we yoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">mpe mu menga maku wukuula, mu dyambu di Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">bantu ba bifumba bimvimba, ba zindinga zimvimba, ba makanda mamvimba na ba zinsi zimvimba.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Mpe wubasidi, bantu bakintinu kimosi na zinganga-Nzambi, mu dyambu di Nzambi eto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">mpe baayaala ha luse lu butoto.»<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Bu nedi talanga, ni nayuwa ndinga yi zimbazi zizingi zizungidila kyandu ki kintinu na ndinga yi bihangu bimoyo mpe na yi zinkuluntu. Baba lutangu lu byazi na byazi, mafunda na mafunda ma bantu kuhyoka kitezo. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Mu ndinga yingolo bedi tanga ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">«Mwana dimeme wuhaanu bonso munkayulu we yoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">wulunga kadi mu tambula lulendo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">kimvwama, ndwenga na ngolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">masiika, nkembo na lusakumunu!»<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Mpe nayuwa bihangu bimvimba bihiduku ku yulu na ha luse lu butoto, ku nsye butoto na mu kati di mubu byedi ta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">« Ku yondowo wudi wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu na ku Mwana Dimeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">bika nkembo, masiika, lusakumunu na lulendo luba mimvu ka mimvu!»<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Bihangu biya bebyobyo bimoyo bivutula ti: «Ameni!» Zinkuluntu ni zifukama, mpe ni zidongama.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nzibululu yi bikangulu bisambanu bintete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Bu nayena Mwana Dimeme bu kazibula kimosi mu bikangulu nsambwadi, ni nayuwa kihangu kimosi mu bihangu biya bimoyo, kyedi zonza mu ndinga yii bonso mumbamina ti: «Yiza!» <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ni nayena mpunda yimosi yimpembe na yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu andi na kitubulu ki dyonga mu kooko, bamuhaana mpu yimosi yi nungunu. Ni kayenda bonso muntu wunungini mu kwe nunga dyaka.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Bu kazibula kikangulu kinzole, ni nayuwa kihangu kinzole kimoyo kyedi ta ti: «Yiza!» <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Bwabu ni nayena mpunda yihiika yimbwaki bonso tiya. Mpe yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu andi, bamuhaana lulendo lwe katula kiyenge ha luse lu butoto mwanki bantu bahondasana yawu na yawu. Ni bamuhaana mbele yiyila yi mvita.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Bu kazibula kikangulu kitatu, ni nayuwa kihangu kitatu kimoyo kyedi ta ti: «Yiza!» Nina yena mpunda yindombe. Yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu andi, wusimba kipezolo kimosi mu kooko kwandi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Mpe nayuwa bonso ndinga ha kati-kati di bihangu biya bimoyo yedi ta ti: «Kitezo kimosi ki bele mu mufutu wu kilumbu kimvimba, mpe bitezo bitatu bi oloze mu mufutu wu kilumbu kimvimba. Kansi kufuukisandi mafuta na vinu ko.»<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Bu kazibula kikangulu kiya, nina yuwa ndinga yi kihangu kiya kimoyo yedi ta ti: «Yiza!» <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ni nayena mpunda yimosi yi mamba ma ntoba. Yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu andi, nkumbu andi Lufwa, mpe nsi yi bafwa yedi kwe mulandi. Ni babahaana lulendo lwe yaadila ndambu yimosi mu ndambu ziya zi luse lu butoto mwanki bahondoso bantu mu mvita, mu malema, mu mayeela na mu bibulu bimbalu bi luse lu butoto.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Bu kazibula kikangulu kitanu, nina yena ku nsye ziku diba kwe yokilanga minkayulu, myela mi bantu bebobo babahonda mu kingolo mu dyambu di Mambu ma Nzambi, mpe mu dyambu di kimbangi ki bata. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Baalooka mu ndinga yingolo na bata ti: «Mfumu yilongo na yikedika, natee nkye ntangu wuna kingila mu fundisa na mu vutula mambi ku bantu bana zinga ha luse lu butoto, mu dyambu di menga meto e?» <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Zwele didila dimpembe dihaanu ku kadi muntu mu yawu, ni babateela bavividila dyaka mwa ntangu yifyoti, natee kwalunga bakundi bawu ba kisalu na zimpangi zawu zibafweti honda bonso yawu mpe.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Bu kazibula kikangulu kisambanu, ni nayena butoto bwedi zakamanga mu ngolo zimvimba. Ntangu yiyiza kituka nabokoboko bonso mpimpa, mpe ngonda yimvimba yiyiza kituka yimbwaki bonso menga, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />mpe mbwetete zii ku yulu zibwa ha butoto bonso bukwe bwilanga mbutu zinkunzu zi muti wu fike wuningusu ku kitembo kingolo. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Yulu dizimbala bonso buuku dibazingidi, milandu mimvimba na bizanga bikatuka ha bifulu byawu. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ntinu zii ha luse lu butoto, zinkuluntu, mfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu, zimvwama, bantu baa na lulendo, bamvimba, mindongo mimvimba na bantu baa na kimpwanza, baswama mu mabulu na mu nsye matadi mamanene maa mu milandu. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Bazonza ku milandu na ku matadi ma mamanene ti: «Tubwidileeno na tuswekeeno kitatu na kiini ki yondowo wudi wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu, mpe kitatu na mankesi ma Mwana Dimeme. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Mu dyambu ti kilumbu kikinene ki mankesi mawu kitudidi, mpe nani lenda vibidila e?»<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi wusa kidimbu ha mbunzu yi bisadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />5 Ku manima ma misamu bemimi, nayena mbazi ziya zitelama mu makonzi maya ma luse lu butoto. Zikakidila bitembo biya bii ha luse lu butoto, mwanki kitembo kilembolo kukula ha luse lu butoto, mu mubu, hoti mu kadi muti. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Mpe nayena mbazi yimosi yihiika, yedi tomboka ku ndambusu yikwe totokilanga ntangu, yisimba kidimbu ki Nzambi yimoyo. Yilooka mu ndinga yingolo ku zimbazi ziya zitambula lulendo mu sa bubi ku butoto na ku mubu. Yita ti: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />«Lusandi bubi ku butoto, ku mubu hoti ku miti ko, natee bu twaasa kidimbu ha mbunzu zi bisadi bi Nzambi eto.» <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Mpe nina yuwa lutangu lu yobobo babasa kidimbu. Baba mafunda nkama na makumaya na ya mu kadi kifumba ki baala ba-Isaeli babasa kidimbu:<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />mu kifumba ki Yuda mafunda kumi na mole (12000)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">babasa kidimbu, mu kifumba ki Lubeni mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">mu kifumba ki Ngadi mafunda kumi na mole (12000),<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />mu kifumba ki Aseli mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">mu kifumba ki Nefitali mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">mu kifumba ki Manase mafunda kumi na mole (12000),<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />mu kifumba ki Simeoni mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">mu kifumba ki Levi mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">mu kifumba ki Isakali mafunda kumi na mole (12000),<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />mu kifumba ki Zabuloni mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">mu kifumba ki Yosefi mafunda kumi na mole (12000),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">mpe mu kifumba ki Benyami mafunda kumi na mole (12000) babasa kidimbu.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, nayena mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu, yo nakani muntu kazabila yo lutangu ko. Yifuma ku zinsi zimvimba, ku bifumba bimvimba, ku makanda mamvimba na ku zindinga zimvimba. Baba batelama ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu na ha ntadisi yi Mwana Dimeme. Balwata mazwele mamala mampembe na mandala mu moko. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Bedi looka mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Mpulusu yikwe fumanga ku Nzambi eto wudi wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu na ku Mwana Dimeme!» <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Mboki, zimbazi zimvimba zizungidila kyandu ki kintinu, zinkuluntu na bihangu biya bimoyo, bamvimba bafulamana luse ha nsi ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu, bafukama na basambila Nzambi <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />ebu: «Ameni! Lusakumunu, nkembo, ndwenga, matondo, masiika, lulendo na ngolo ku Nzambi eto vwidi byo mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!»<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Mboki wumosi mu zinkuluntu wumfula ti: «Yobobo balweti mazwele mamala mampembe, banani badi e? Kwedi bafumini e?» <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ni namuvutudila ti: «Mfumu ani, ngeye wazebi!» Ni kanteela ti: «Ni yobobo babayenisi mpasi zizingi, basukudi mazwele mawu mamala, mpe bakitudi mo mampembe mu menga ma Mwana Dimeme. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ni hahoho badi ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi mu musambila mpimpa na mwini mu nzo-Nzambi andi. Yondowo wudi wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu, waabalunda mu nzo andi. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Baabwesa yena nsatu ko na baabwesa yena mpwila ko. Ntangu yaabwesa bayoka ko na mbangasi yaabwesa bayoka ko. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Mu dyambu ti, Mwana Dimeme wudi ha kati di kyandu ki kintinu, waaba munkengi awu na waabanata ku nto zi mamba ma luzingu, mpe Nzambi waakusuna manswela mu meso mawu.»<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Nzibululu yi kikangulu kinsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Mwana dimeme bu kazibula kikangulu kinsambwadi, ku yulu ku tumbu ba napii, kampe kati-kati di kilokola. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Mboki nayena mbazi nsambwadi zitelama ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Babahaana makulumenta nsambwadi.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Mbazi yihiika yiyiza telama ha ntendo ziku di bakwe yokilanga mananasi ma mfuku yimbote, wusimba kuku di wola di bakwe yokilanga maaka mamfuku yimbote. Bamuhaana maaka mamingi mamfuku yimbote, mwanki kahaana mo, ha kimosi na zinsambulu zi balongo bamvimba, ha yulu ziku di wola di bakwe yokilanga mananasi ma mfuku yimbote, dii ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Mwisi wu maaka mamfuku yimbote wedi tombokanga ha kooko ku mbazi, wutomboka ha kimosi na zinsambulu zi balongo, ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Mboki, mbazi wubonga kuku di wola, wufulusa dyo mu tiya tu ziku di bakwe yokilanga mananasi ma mfuku yimbote, ni kalosa dyo ku ndambusu yi luse lu butoto. Buna mimbamina mitendana, ndinga ziduma, mpedamu ziyenika na butoto buzakama.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makulumenta masambanu mantete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Zimbazi nsambwadi zisimba makulumenta nsambwadi, zikubama mu sika mo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Mbazi yintete yisika kulumenta. Mvula yi matadi na tiya tuvwatana na menga, bibwa ha luse lu butoto. Mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi butoto yihya, mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu zi miti yihya na bititi bimamba bimvimba bihya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Mbazi yinzole yisika kulumenta. Kibaba ki butoto, kii bonso mulandu wuwunene wulema mu tiya, kibwa mu mubu. Mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu yitatu yi mubu yikituka menga. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi bihangu bimvimba bikwe zinganga mu mubu yifwa, mpe mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi masuwa mamvimba yimwangana.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Mbazi yitatu yisika kulumenta. Lubwetete lumosi lulunene, lwedi kwe lemi bonso mulaka wu tiya, lufuma ku yulu lubwa. Lubwa mu mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu zi nzadi na mu zinto zi mamba. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Mpe nkumbu yi lubwetete belolo, yiba «Abisenti», mpila mosi ti muti wundudi. Mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu zi mamba yikituka ndudi mpe bantu babingi mu yobobo banwa mo, bafwa, mu dyambu ti maba ndudi.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Mbazi yiya yisika kulumenta. Mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi ntangu, mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi ngonda na mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi zimbwetete, yibaka nsembolo, mwanki mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yikota mu tombe: kilumbu kizimbisa mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi kya kwandi, bumosi mpe mpimpa.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Bu natala dyaka, nayuwa mbemba yedi kwe pidumuki nkatika ku yulu ha mbata mutu, yita mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Nkatika kyadi! Nkatika kyadi! Nkatika kyadi ku bantu bazakadi ha luse lu butoto mu ntangu mbazi zitatu zihiika, bu zaasika makulumenta mawu!»<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Mbazi yitanu yisika kulumenta. Nayena ku yulu lubwetete lumosi lubwa ha butoto. Ni bahaana lo nsabi yi mwelo wu bulu dinsisi ditoma sunda. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Lubwetete luzibula bulu di nsisi ditoma sunda, mwisi wedi totoka momo, wuba bonso mwisi wu kifuudu ki tiya tungolo. Ntangu na mupepe bidyama ku nsye mwisi bewowo. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Makonko matotoka mu kati di mwisi na mamwangana ha luse lu butoto, mpe bahaana mo lulendo lumosi lufwanakani na lulendo luu na zinkutu-nkutu. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Babadika mu vuza bititi bii ha luse lu butoto na bititi bihiika bimamba, mpe na miti mimvimba. Kansi babahaana luve mu hidika kaka misamu mimbi ku bantu bebobo balembolo ba na kidimbu ki Nzambi ha mbunzu. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Babahaana luve ko mu bahonda, kansi mu bayenisa kaka mpasi mu ngonda zitanu. Mpasi zikwe yenisanga makonko, zifwanakani na miswa mi nkutu-nkutu tala ti yitatikidi muntu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, bantu baalomba lufwa, kansi baafwa ko, baatya mu fwa, kansi lufwa lwaabatatukila.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Makonko bemomo, maba mafwanakana na zimpunda zibakubikidi mu nwana mvita. Ha yulu mitu myawu, haba na bima bii bonso mpu ziwola, mpe biini byawu biba bonso biini bi bantu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Milengi myawu miba bonso milengi mi bakento, mpe meeno mawu maba bonso meeno ma zinkosi. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ntulu zawu ziba zifukama bonso binkutu bi kisengo kikwe kebanga ntulu, mpe lusuku lu mahahi mawu lufwanakana na lusuku lu makaalu ma bana kwe nani mu muswalu ku zimpunda zizingi mu kwe nwana mvita. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Makonko bemomo, maba na masaka mafuluka mu biba, bonso bii na zinkutu-nkutu, mpe mu masaka mawu muba na lulendo mu hidika ku bantu misamu mimbi, mu ngonda tanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ntinu awu yiba mbazi yi bulu dinsisi disunda, mu ndinga yi kihebeleo nkumbu andi Abadoni na mu ndinga yi kingeleke Apolyoni, mpila mosi ti «Kimwangisi».<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Musamu wuntete wumpasi wuhyoka. Ku manima, misamu myole mihiika mimpasi myaakwiza dyaka.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Mbazi yisambanu yisika kulumenta. Nayuwa ndinga yifuma mu masiki maya ma ziku di wola diba kwe yokilanga mananasi ma mfuku yimbote, dii ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Ndinga yita ku mbazi yisambanu yisimba kulumenta ti: «Haana kimpwanza ku zimbazi ziya zibakengi bela-bela na nzadi yiyinene yi bakwe tumisinanga ti Efalata.» <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Mpe bahaana kimpwanza ku mbazi ziya, zozozo zi bakubika mu kilokola bekyokyo, mu kilumbu bekyokyo, mu ngonda beyoyo na mu mvula beyoyo, mwanki zihonda mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi bantu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Nayuwa lutangu lu zimbulu-mbulu ziba mu yulu zimpunda: luba nkama zole zi byazi. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ni hahoho, nayena mu mbweno zimpunda na yobobo baba bazakala ha yulu awu: balwata ha ntulu binkutu bi kisengo mu keba ntulu, biba na ntinta yimbwaki bonso tiya, ntinta yi yulu bonso yasente na ntinta yi mwamba ngazi bonso sufele. Mitu mi zimpunda miba bonso mitu mi zinkosi, minwa myawu myedi duukisa tiya, mwisi na sufele. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Bahonda mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu yi bantu mu mayeela matatu ema: tiya, mwisi na sufele medi duuka mu minwa myawu. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Mu dyambu ti, lulendo lu zimpunda ludi mu minwa na mu masaka mawu. Masaka mawu madi bonso zinyoka, mpe mitu myawu ni myamyomyo mi bakwe yenisinanga bantu mpasi.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Bantu bahiika balembolo hondo ku mayeela bemomo, babiika nkadulu awu ko. Babiika ko mu sambila mpeve zimbi, biteki bi wola, bi palata, bi nsongo, bi matadi na bi mabaya bilembolo ba na lulendo mu yena, mu yuwa na mu dyata. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Babiika mu honda ko, mu sadila mpandu ko, kindumba na bwivi ko.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mbazi na buuku didikeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Mboki nayena mbazi yihiika yilulendo yifuma ku mazulu yedi kulumuka, yifuku ku tuti dimosi na mukyama wuzungidila mutu andi. Kiini kyandi kiba bonso ntangu na malu mandi bonso makunzi ma tiya. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Wusimba ha kooko kwandi buuku dimosi didikeke diba dimwasi. Wutuula kuulu kulubakala mu mubu na kuulu kulumoso ha butoto. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Wulooka mu ngolo bonso nkosi yina duma. Mu mulooko wandi, mimbamina nsambwadi miyuwikisa ndinga zawu. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Bu mimanisa mu zonza, natya mu sonika misamu bemyomyo mizonza mimbamina nsambwadi, kansi nina yuwa ndinga yimosi mu mazulu yita ti: «Keba mansweki ma misamu bemyomyo miteedi mimbamina nsambwadi, kusonikandi myo.»<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Buna, mbazi yi nayena yitelama ha yulu mubu mpe ha butoto, yinanguna kooko ku lubakala ku yulu. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Na yidya ndefi mu nkumbu yondowo wuna zinga mimvu ka mimvu, wuhidika yulu na bima bii koko, butoto na bima bii ha butoto, mubu na bima bii momo. Mbazi yita ti: «Ntangu ye kingila yisidi dyaka ko! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Kansi mu bilumbu byaasika mbazi yinsambwadi kulumenta, mansweki ma Nzambi maalunga bonso bu nata Musamu Wumbote wukasamuna ku mimbikudi, bisadi byandi.»<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ndinga yi nayuwa, yifuma ku yulu, yizonza dyaka naani. Yinteela ti: «Yenda wubonga buuku didikeke dimwasi, dii mu kooko ku mbazi, yitelamani ha yulu mubu na ha butoto.»<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Bu nafinama ha bela mbazi, namubombidila kampaana buuku didikeke. Wunteela ti: «Bonga dyo na dya dyo. Dyaakitula moyo aku ndudi, kansi dyaaba mu munwa aku nanzekinzeki bonso nyosi.»<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ni nabonga buuku didikeke diba mu kooko ku mbazi, ni nadya dyo. Diba nanzekinzeki mu munwa ani bonso nyosi, kansi bu namina dyo, ni dikitula moyo ani ndudi.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ni hahoho banteela ti: «Fweti bikula dyaka ku bantu babingi, ku zinsi, ku zindinga na ku zintinu.»<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mbangi zole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ku manima, bampaana dyadya dimosi difwanakana na mwa muti mu tanga zimetele. Banteela ti: «Yenda tanga zimetele zii mu nzo-Nzambi na zii ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu, mpe tanga yobobo bakwe sambilanga momo. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Kansi, kutangandi zimetele zii ku mbazi yi nzo-Nzambi, mu dyambu ti mbazi yabahaana ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. Yawu baamwangisa mbanza yilongo mu ngonda makumaya na zole. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mbo nahaana lulendo lwe bikula ku zimbangi zani zole, zilweti nsaku mu lonka kifwidi, mu bilumbu funda dimosi na nkama zole na makumasambanu.»<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Mbangi zole bezozo zidi bonso miti myole mi olive na bitentokolo byole bi minda bidi bitelama ha ntadisi yi Mfumu yi luse lu butoto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:3">Zak 4.3</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 4:11">11</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Tala ti muntu wuna sosa mu bahidika misamu mimbi, tiya twaduuka mu minwa myawu na twanyengisa mitantu myawu. Tala ti muntu wuna kana mu bahidikila misamu mimbi, bwabobo kaafwila. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Baa na lulendo mu kanga mvula mu bilumbu bi mbikudulu awu. Mpe baa na lulendo mu kitula mamba menga na mu semba luse lu butoto mu mayeela ma mumpila-mumpila bonso bu batiidi.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Bu bamanisa mu ta kimbangi kyawu, kibulu kinatomboka mu bulu dinsisi, kyaabanwanisa, kyaababedisa na kyaabahonda. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mvumbi zawu zaaba mu nzila yisadila yi mbanza yiyinene yi bakwe tumisinanga mu kifwani kii bonso mbanza yi Sodomo hoti nsi yi Ngipiti. Mu mbanza beyoyo yi bakomina Mfumu awu ha kulunsi. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Bantu ba makanda mamvimba, bifumba bimvimba, zindinga na zinsi zimvimba, baasa bilumbu bitatu na ndambu mu tala mvumbi zawu, mpe baabahaana luve ko mu ziika zimvumbi. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Bantu bana zinga ha luse lu butoto, baayangalala mu dyambu dyawu, baasa mukembo, baahaanasana yawu na yawu minkayulu, mu dyambu ti mimbikudi myole bemyomyo mitoma yenisa mpasi bantu baa ha luse lu butoto.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ku manima ma bilumbu bitatu na ndambu, mpeve yimosi yifuma ku Nzambi, yikwe haananga luzingu, yikota mu yawu, mboki ni batelama. Bantu bebobo bedi batalanga, baabaka bunkuta bubwingi. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Bayuwa ndinga yimosi yingolo yifuma ku yulu, yibateela ti: «Tombokeeno eha!» Batomboka ku yulu mu kati di tuti, ha meso ma mitantu myawu. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, butoto buzakama mu ngolo, ndambu yimosi mu ndambu kumi yi mbanza yi mwangana. Mafunda nsambwadi ma bantu mahondo mu butoto bebobo buzakama. Bantu bahiika babaka kintekoto na bakembisa Nzambi yi mazulu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Mpasi zinzole zihyokidi. Zitatu zina kwiza mu mwa bilumbu bifyoti.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulumenta di nsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Buna mbazi yinsambwadi yisika kulumenta. Ndinga zizinene ziyuwakana ku yulu, zita ti: «Kintinu ki nza kyeka bwabu mu moko ma Mfumu eto na Klisto andi, mpe waayaala mimvu ka mimvu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">Yes 9.7</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Zinkuluntu makumole na ziya ziba zizakala mu byandu byawu bi kintinu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, zidongama luse ha nsi, mpe zisambila Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />Zita ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">«Matondo tuna kuvutudila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Mfumu Nzambi yi lulendo lumvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Mfumu yi bima bimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ngeye wudi na wuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">mu dyambu ti wulonkidi bunene bu lulendo lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">wutungidi Kimfumu kyaku.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Nsi zimeni nangumuka mu mankesi mu dyambu dyaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kansi bwabu ni mankesi maku mana yenika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ntangu ye fundisa bafwa yifweni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ntangu yi waasendila mimbikudi bisadi byaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">bamvimba bebobo bavwihulu ku Nzambi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">na bazitisi kimfumu kyaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">bantu bamfunu hoti ba bakwe tyakanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ntangu yifweni ye mwangisa yobobo bana mwangisa nza<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Mik 2.1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:5">5</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Nzo-Nzambi yizibuka mu mazulu, mpe nkela yi luwawanu lwandi yiyenika momo. Buna mpedamu ziyenika, ndinga ziyuwakana, mimbamina mitendana, butoto buzakama na mvula yi matadi yingolo yibwa.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mukento wutina Ndalango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Kidimbu kimosi kikinene kiyenika ku yulu: mukento wumosi wulwata ntangu. Ngonda yiba ku nsye bitambi byandi, ha yulu mutu wuba na mpu yi kintinu yi mbwetete kumi na zole. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Zimi diba nandi, mpe wedi looka mu dyambu di mpasi zi misongo mye butila.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Kidimbu kihiika kiyenika ku yulu: ndalango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ndalango, yidi bonso kibulu kinsisi kikinene na kimbalu</char></note> yimosi yiyinene yimbwaki bonso tiya, yiba na mitu nsambwadi na masiki kumi, mpe mpu yimosi yi kintinu mu kadi mutu. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mu saka dyandi wukombola mwa ndambu yimosi mu ndambu zitatu mu zimbwetete zi mazulu na wulosa zo ha luse lu butoto. Ndalango wuyiza telama ha ntwala yi mukento wuba lukufi mu buta, mwanki kakakuna mwana andi bu katumbu buta. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Wubuta mwana wubakala waatwadisa makanda mamvimba, na muhangu wu kisengo. Hansi na nsi, mwana wunangunu ku Nzambi na ku kyandu kyandi ki kintinu. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Mukento wuwoka ku nsi yinkatu, kumukubikila Nzambi kibuka, mwanki bamudikila koko bilumbu funda dimosi nkama zole na makumasambanu.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Buna, mvita yimosi yibwa ku yulu. Mikali na zimbazi zandi banwanisa Ndalango. Ndalango wunwana yandi mpe ha kimosi na zimbazi zandi. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Kansi Ndalango kavudila ngolo ko, mpe baba dyaka na luve mu zakala ku yulu ko. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Balosa Ndalango yiyinene. Ni yoyoyo yidi nyoka yintama yi bakwe tumisinanga ti Nkadyampemba na Satana, yayoyo yina zimbisa bantu bazakadi ha luse lu butoto bumvimba. Bamulosa ha kimosi na zimbazi zandi ha luse lu butoto bumvimba.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ni nayuwa ndinga yimosi yingolo yifuma ku mazulu, yita ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">«Bwabu ntangu yi fweni yi mpulusu, yi lulendo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">yi Kimfumu ki Nzambi eto na yi luyaalu lu Klisto andi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Mu dyambu ti, Mumfundi wu zimpangi zeto bamulosidi ku mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Yondowo wedi bafundanga mpimpa na mwini, ha ntadisi yi Nzambi eto.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Kansi, yawu bamubedisa mu menga ma Mwana Dimeme</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">na mu mambu ma kimbangi kyawu ki bata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Batina mu yekola luzingu lwawu ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">baba bakubama mu fwa.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ni hahoho, mazulu na yeno lukwe zinganga koko, yangalaleeno!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Kansi nkye mpila kyadi ku yeeno butoto na mubu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Mu dyambu ti, Nkadyampemba kulumukini ku yeeno na nganzi zimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">bu kazebi ti mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yimusidi.»<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ndalango bu kayena ti bamulosidi ha luse lu butoto, ni kalanda mukento wubuta mwana wubakala. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Kansi, ni bahaana ku mukento mahahi mole ma mbemba yiyinene, mwanki kapidumuka natee ha kibuka ki bamukubikila ku nsi yinkatu. Kwakoko ku kadikulu mvula tatu na ndambu, kitatu na nyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Buna nyoka wuluka mamba bonso nzadi ku manima ma mukento, mwanki ma mukungumuna. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Kansi, butoto buyiza sadisa mukento, bu kazibula munwa andi na bu kamina nzadi yiluka Ndalango mu munwa andi. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Mu nganzi ziba nandi mu mukento, Ndalango wuyenda nwanisa mwa ndambu yi bantu basala mu nkuna andi. Ni yobobo bakwe kebanga mina mi Nzambi na bakwe teelanga Yesu kimbangi.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Buna Ndalango wutelama ha kumu di mubu ha yulu munyenge.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bibulu byole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Mboki, nayena kibulu kimosi kitomboka mu mubu, kiba na masiki kumi na mitu nsambwadi. Kiba mpe kilwata mpu yi kintinu mu kadi siki na mu mitu myandi muba musonama nkumbu ze safudila Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Kibulu ki nayena, kiba kifwanakana na ngo, malu mandi maba bonso ma kibulu ki uluse na munwa andi wuba bonso wu nkosi. Ndalango wumuhaana lulendo lwandi, kyandu kyandi ki kintinu na luyaalu lulunene. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Wumosi mu mitu myandi, wuba bonso wulwala mputa yiketi muhonda, kansi mputa yiketi muhonda yihola. Nza yimvimba yiyituku na yilanda kibulu. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Bantu bamvimba bafukama ha ntadisi yi ndalango mu muzitisa, mu dyambu ti wuhaana lulendo ku kibulu. Mpe basambila kibulu na bata ti: «Nani fwanakani na kibulu mpe nani lenda munwanisa e?»<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Bamuhaana nzila mu duukisa mpova zimayama na mu safula Nzambi, mpe wutambula lulendo mu sala kisalu mu ngonda makumaya na zole. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Wutona mu safula Nzambi, wusafula nkumbu andi na kibuka ki kakwe banga, mpe na bamvimba bakwe banga ku yulu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Wutambula lulendo mu nwanisa bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, mpe na mu babedisa. Wutambula lulendo mu bifumba bimvimba, mu makanda mamvimba, mu zindinga zimvimba na mu zinsi zimvimba. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Bantu bamvimba baa ha luse lu butoto baamusambila, yobobo bamvimba balembolo ba na nkumbu zisonama, tuka ku mbadukulu yi nza, mu buuku di luzingu. Mpe buuku bedyodyo didi di Mwana Dimeme wubahaana bonso munkayulu.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />«Bika yondowo wuu na makutu kayuwa! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Tala ti muntu mu kinkole kaakwenda, waakwenda mu kinkole. Tala ti muntu mu mbele yi mvita kaafwila, waafwa mu mbele yi mvita. Ni hahoho, bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, bafweti ba na luvibudulu na kiminu.»<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Mboki, nayena kibulu kihiika kyedi totoka ku nsye butoto. Masiki mole maba nandi, mafwanakana na masiki ma Mwana Dimeme, na wedi zonzanga bonso ndalango. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Wusadila lulendo lumvimba lu kibulu kintete ha meso mandi, mpe wusa ti butoto na bantu bazakadi hoho, basambila kibulu kintete kiba na mputa yihola, yiketi munata ku lufwa. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Wusa ha ntadisi yi bantu bidimbu bibinene, mpe wukulumuna tiya ha luse lu butoto tuka ku mazulu ha meso ma bantu. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Wuhuna bantu baa ha luse lu butoto, mu bidimbu bingitukulu bi bamuhaanina luve mu sa ha meso ma kibulu kintete. Wulomba ku bantu baa ha luse lu butoto, bahidika kiteki kinzitusu ki kibulu bekyokyo kilwala mu mbele yi mvita, kansi kifwa ko.<verse eid="REV 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Kibulu kinzole kitambula lulendo mu haana kihumunu ku kiteki ki kibulu kintete, mwanki kiteki bekyokyo kizonza na kihondoso bantu bamvimba bebobo baalembolo kye sambila. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Kibulu kikwikisa bantu bamvimba, bihunda na baala bafyoti, zimvwama na bamputu, mindongo na bantu bakimpwanza, batambula mu sihu kidimbu ha mbunzu hoti mu kooko ku lubakala. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kuu muntu ko wulenda sumba hoti wulenda yadika tala ti kadi na kidimbu bekyokyo ko, mpila mosi ti nkumbu yi kibulu hoti lutangu lufwanakani na nkumbu beyoyo.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Musamu bewuwu wuna lomba ndwenga. Yondowo wuu na madyela lenda bakula mbangudulu yi lutangu lu kibulu, mu dyambu ti lutangu belolo, lufwanakani na nkumbu yi muntu. Lutangu belolo ni nkama sambanu na makumasambanu na sambanu (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Mwana dimeme na bantu bakakuula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Nayena Mwana Dimeme wutelama ha yulu mulandu wu Syoni ha kimosi na mafunda nkama na makumaya na ya (144000) ma bantu baba na nkumbu andi, mpe na nkumbu yi Tata andi zisonama ha mbunzu awu. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nina yuwa ndinga yifuma ku yulu bonso lusuku lu mamba mamingi ma ntadi na bonso lusuku lu mumbamina wutendani, mpe nayuwa ndinga yiba bonso muningu wu bisiki bi lungoyingoyi, bedi sika bisikulu byawu. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Bayimbila mukunga wumoona ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu na ha ntadisi yi bihangu biya bimoyo na ha ntadisi yi binunu. Kuba na muntu ko wulenda mu longoka mukunga bewowo. Balenda mu longoka wo ni mafunda nkama na makumaya na ya (144000) ma bantu, yobobo babakuula ha luse lu butoto.<verse eid="REV 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Bantu bebobo, ni yobobo balembolo sumuka na bakento, mu dyambu ti bavedila baba. Bakwe landanga Mwana Dimeme konso-konso ku kana kwenda, mpe babakuula ha kati di bantu mu ba bonso mimbutu mintete ku Nzambi na ku Mwana Dimeme. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Mu munwa awu, mwatotokidi misamu mi luvunu ko, mpe kuu na dyambu di balendi babakila kibila ko.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbazi zitatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Nayena mbazi yihiika yedi kwe pidumuki ha kati-kati di yulu. Yiba na Musamu Wumbote wu mimvu ka mimvu we samuna ku bantu baa ha luse lu butoto, ku zinsi zimvimba, ku bifumba bimvimba, ku zindinga zimvimba na ku makanda mamvimba. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Yita mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Zitiseeno Nzambi, mpe mukembiseeno mu dyambu ti, ntangu yi kana fundisa yifweni. Sambileeno ha ntadisi yi yondowo wuhidika yulu, butoto, mubu na zinto zi mamba!»<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Mbazi yinzole yilanda yintete yita ti: «Yibwidi, yibwidi, mbanza yiyinene yi Babiloni! Yinwikisi zinsi zimvimba vinu di mankesi ma kindumba kyandi!»<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ku manima ma mbazi zole zintete, mbazi yitatu yilanda na yizonza mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Tala ti muntu sambidi kibulu na kiteki kyandi, mpe tambudi kidimbu ha mbunzu hoti ha kooko kwandi, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />yandi mpe waanwa vinu di mankesi ma Nzambi, dibabulumuni dilembolo vwatusu na kima mu mbungu yi mankesi ma Nzambi! Mpe waakwamusu mu kati di tiya na sufele, ha ntadisi yi zimbazi zilongo na yi Mwana Dimeme! <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Mwisi wu mpasi zawu, wuna tomboka mimvu ka mimvu. Baahuma ko mpimpa na mwini, yobobo bakwe sambilanga kibulu na kiteki kyandi, mpe yobobo bamvimba batambudi kidimbu kyandi.»<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Yi ni ntangu yi mvibudulu yi bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, bakwe kebanga mina mi Nzambi na kiminu mu Yesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Mboki nayuwa ndinga yimosi ku mazulu yita ti: «Sonika: “Kyese ku bantu bana fwa bwabu mu Mfumu mu ntangu beyiyi!” “Ninga, Mpeve yiteedi ti: Bika bahuma mu bisalu byawu, mu dyambu ti mavanga mawu mana balanda !”»<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyonzokolo yi mbutu zii ha luse lu butoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Meno nayena tuti dimosi dimpembe na muntu wuba wuzakala ha yulu tuti, wufwanakana na Mwana Muntu. Wuba na mpu yi kintinu yi wola ha yulu mutu na ha kooko kwandi, wuba na mbele yikondama yimeeno. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Mbazi yihiika yiduuka mu nzo-Nzambi, yilooka mu ndinga yingolo ku yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu tuti ti: «Simba mbele aku yikondama na yonzika mbutu, ntangu yifweni ye yonzika zo, mu dyambu ti mbutu zii ha luse lu butoto ziyedidi!» <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ni hahoho, yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu tuti, wulosa mbele andi yikondama ha luse lu butoto na wuyonzika mbutu zimvimba zii ha luse lu butoto.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Mbazi yihiika yiduuka mu nzo-Nzambi yii ku mazulu. Yiba yawu mpe na mbele yikondama yimeeno.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Mbazi yihiika yiba na lulendo lwe yaala tiya, yiduuka ha ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu. Yilooka mu ndinga yingolo ku yondowo wuba na mbele yikondama yimeeno ti: «Simba mbele aku yikondama yimeeno na yonzika bikanka bi mbutu zi muti wu vinu zii ha luse lu butoto, mu dyambu ti ziyedidi.» <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Mbazi yilosa mbele andi yikondama ha luse lu butoto. Yiyonzika mbutu zi muti wu vinu zii ha luse lu butoto, mpe yilosa mbutu zikayonzika mu kikamununu kikinene ki mankesi ma Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Bakamuna mbutu mu kikamununu ku mbazi yi mbanza, menga ni maduuka momo na mafuluka natee mu kitezo ki minwa mi zimpunda, mpe mamwangana mu zikilometele nkama tatu (300).<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mbazi na mayeela mamanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Nayena dyaka ku yulu kidimbu kihiika kikinene na kingitukulu: mbazi nsambwadi zisimba mu moko mayeela nsambwadi mamanunu, mu dyambu ti mu mayeela bemomo mankesi ma Nzambi malungila.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Nayena bonso mubu wuu nakyenzikyenzi wufwanakana na tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima, wuvwatana na tiya. Bantu bamvimba bebobo babedisa kibulu, kiteki kyandi na lutangu lufwanakana na nkumbu andi, baba batelama ha yulu mubu bewowo wuu nakyenzikyenzi wufwanakana na tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima. Baba na lungoyingoyi mu moko bibahaana Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Bayimbila mukunga wu Mose kisadi ki Nzambi, na mukunga wu Mwana Dimeme ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">«Mfumu Nzambi, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">bisalu byaku biba bibinene na bingitukulu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Nzila zaku zilunungu na zikedika zidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">ntinu yi zinsi wudi.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Mfumu, nani walembolo kuzitisa na walembolo kembila nkumbu aku e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Kadi ngeye kaka wudi wulongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">mu dyambu ti, zinsi zimvimba zaakwiza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">na zaasambila ha ntadisi aku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">mu dyambu ti nzengolo zaku ziyenikini.»<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ku manima, nayena nzo-Nzambi yizibuka mu mazulu na mu kati muba na nzo yi kikapu yi luwawanu lu Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Mbazi nsambwadi zisimba mayeela nsambwadi, zitotoka mu Nzo-Nzambi. Ziba zilwata binkutu bilino biba navekoveko, mpe zilwata melika zi wola zizungidila ntulu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Kimosi mu bihangu biya bimoyo, kihaana ku mbazi nsambwadi, mbungu nsambwadi zi wola, zifuluka mu mankesi ma Nzambi kwe zinganga mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Nzo-Nzambi yifuluka mu mwisi mu dyambu di nkembo na lulendo lu Nzambi. Kuu muntu ko wulenda kota mu nzo-Nzambi, natee mayeela nsambwadi ma zimbazi nsambwadi bu maalunga.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mbungu nsambwadi zi mankesi ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Nayuwa mu nzo-Nzambi ndinga yizonza mu ngolo na yita ku mbazi nsambwadi ti: «Yendeeno na mwangiseeno ha luse lu butoto, mbungu nsambwadi zi mankesi ma Nzambi!»<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Mbazi yintete yiyenda na yimwangisa mbungu andi ha luse lu butoto. Buna mputa zimyangala zedi zikutinanga zizibuka mu bantu bebobo baba na kidimbu ki kibulu, mpe basambila kiteki.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Mbazi yizole yimwangisa mbungu andi mu mubu. Mamba makituka menga bonso ma mvumbi na bimvimba biba bimoyo mu mubu bimana fwa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Mbazi yitatu yimwangisa mbungu andi mu zinzadi na mu zinto zi mamba, mamba mamvimba makituka menga. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Nayuwa mbazi yikwe yaalanga mamba yita ti: «Ngeye wulongo, wudi na wuba, wulunungu wudi mu fundisila bobo. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Bantu batengodi menga ma bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na ma mimbikudi, mpe wubaheeni menga banwa, bwabobo bufwanakani ku yawu!» <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Mboki, nayuwa ndinga yifuma ku ziku diba kwe yokilanga minkayulu yita ti: «Ninga, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba, mfundusulu zaku zikedika na zilunungu zidi!»<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Mbazi yiya yimwangisa mbungu andi ha ntangu. Ni bamuhaana luve mu yoka bantu mu tiya twandi. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Mpe bantu bahya mu mbangasi yingitukulu. Basafula nkumbu Nzambi wuu na lulendo mu mayeela bebobo, kansi babisa kwawu mu viluka na mu mukembila.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Mbazi yitanu yimwangisa mbungu andi ha kyandu ki kintinu ki kibulu, mpe kimfumu kyandi ni kikota ku nsye kitombe. Bantu bakitatika ludimi mu myangala, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />basafula Nzambi yi mazulu mu dyambu di myangala myawu na mputa zawu. Kansi, babisa mu bika mavanga mawu.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Mbazi yisambanu yimwangisa mbungu andi mu nzadi yiyinene yii nkumbu Efalata. Nzadi ni yiyuma, mwanki yihaana nzila ku zintinu zifumini ku ndambusu yikwe duukilanga ntangu. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Mboki, nayena mpeve zitatu zilembolo ba zivedila zifwanakana na mahono, zedi duuka. Yimosi mu munwa wu Ndalango, yimosi mu munwa wu kibulu, mpe yimosi mu munwa wu mumbikudi wuluvunu. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Zozozo ni mpeve zimbi zina sa bidimbu bingitukulu. Zina kwenda ku zintinu zi nza yimvimba, mu bakutikisa mu nwana mvita yi kilumbu kikinene ki Nzambi, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Mfumu ebu kateedi: «Tala, nina kwiza bonso mwivi. Kyese ku yondowo wuna kaya meso na wuna keba binkutu byandi, mwanki kalembolo dyata mpene, mpe kalembolo yena nsoni ha meso ma bantu.»<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Mpeve zimbi zikutikisa zintinu ha kibuka kibakwe tumisinanga mu ndinga yi kihebeleo ti Halamangendoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Mbazi yi nsambwadi yimwangisa mbungu andi mu yulu. Ndinga yingolo yiyuwakana ha kyandu ki kintinu kii mu nzo-Nzambi, yita ti: «Bulungidi!» <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Buna mpedamu ziyenika, ndinga ziyuwakana, mimbamina mitendana na butoto buzakama mu ngolo. Twayeni kuzakama ku bobo ko tuka bantu bu baa ha luse lu butoto. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Mbanza yiyinene yikabuka mu ndambu zitatu. Mbanza zi zinsi zimvimba zibwa. Nzambi wubambukila moyo mbanza yiyinene yi Babiloni, bu kamunwikisa mbungu yi vinu di nganzi zandi. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Bizanga bimvimba bidyama na milandu mizimbala. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mvula yi matadi mazita yifuma ku yulu yinokono bantu. Mpe bantu basafula Nzambi, mu dyambu diyeela di mvula yi matadi, mu dyambu ti diba yeela dihyokidi ngolo.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mfundusu yi mukento wu kindumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ni hahoho, yimosi mu zimbazi nsambwadi yisimba mbungu nsambwadi bezozo, yiyiza moka naani mu nteela ti: «Yiza, mbo nakulonka bwedi bwabela mfundusu yi mukento wu kindumba kihyokidi kitezo, wuu wuzakala ha kumu di mamba mamanene.» <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Ntinu zii ha luse lu butoto, zisadila kindumba nandi, mpe bantu baa ha luse lu butoto, bakolo vinu di kindumba kyandi.<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Buna Mpeve yi ndwata na mbazi yintwadisa ku nsi yinkatu. Kuuna nayena mukento wumosi wuzakala ha yulu kibulu kimbwaki. Nitu yi kibulu bekyokyo yiba yifuluka mu nkumbu ze safudila Nzambi, mpe kiba na mitu nsambwadi na masiki kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mukento bewowo, wuba wulwata milele mintalu mimbwaki yina lezima, misanga mi wola, mi matadi mantalu na mi palata. Wusimba mu kooko kwandi mbungu yi wola yifuluka mu misamu minsisi na mu busafu bu kindumba kyandi. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ha mbunzu andi haba hasonama, nkumbu yi mansweki: «Mbanza yiyinene yi Babiloni, ngudi yi bakento bakwe sadilanga kindumba na misamu minsisi mii ha luse lu butoto.» <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Nayena mukento bewowo wukolo mu menga ma bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na mu menga ma zimbangi zi Yesu. Bu namuyena, ni natumbu yituku bubwingi.<verse eid="REV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Mbazi yinteela ti: «Bila nki wuna yitukulu e? Meno, mbo nakuteela mansweki ma mukento na ma kibulu ki nakwe munati, kibulu bekyokyo kii na mitu nsambwadi na masiki kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Kibulu kiyeeni, kiba kimoyo, kansi kisaala dyaka ko. Kyaatomboka mu bulu dinsisi na kyaazimbala. Bantu ha luse lu butoto, yobobo balembolo ba na nkumbu yisonama mu mukanda wumoyo tuuka mbadukulu yi nza, baayituku bu baayena kibulu, mu dyambu ti kiba, kansi kisaala ko, mpe kyaabwesa yenika dyaka.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Ehaha, hana lomba madyela na ndwenga. Mitu nsambwadi ni milandu nsambwadi mizakadi mukento, midi mpe ni ntinu nsambwadi. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Ntinu zitanu ha kati dyawu zibwa, yimosi yisambanu yina yaala ntangu beyiyi, mpe yi nsambwadi yayizidi ko. Bu yaakwiza, mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yaazinga. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Kibulu kiba kimoyo, kansi kisaala dyaka ko, kidi kyabende ntinu yinana. Kidi mpe kimosi mu zintinu nsambwadi na kyaazimbala.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Masiki kumi ma wuyeni, ni zintinu kumi zilembolo tona mu yaala, kansi zaatambula mu kilokola kimosi, lulendo mu yaala ha kimosi na kibulu. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Yawu kumi bamvimba, makani mamosi badi: mu tuula lulendo lwawu na ngolo zawu mu kibulu. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Baanwanisa Mwana Dimeme, mpe yandi waababedisa, mu dyambu ti Mfumu yi zimfumu na Ntinu yi zintinu kadi. Mpe yobobo baanunga ha kimosi nandi, ni babatumisa, babasoola na baba bakwikama.»<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Mbazi yinteela dyaka ti: «Mamba mo ma wuyeni, ha zakala mukento wu kindumba, ni mikangu, mpumbu zi bantu, zinsi na zindinga. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Masiki kumi ma wuyeni na kibulu, baanyafuna mukento wu kindumba, baamubonga bima bimvimba na baamusa mpene yimungwa, baadya misunya myandi na baamuyoka ku tiya. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wutuula mu mitima myawu luzolo mu lungisa nsilulu andi. Masiki kumi, mpila mosi ti zintinu kumi zaayuwasana mu haana ku kibulu kintinu kyawu, natee Mambu ma Nzambi bu mana lunga.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Mukento wu wuyeni, ni mbanza yiyinene yina yaala ntinu zii ha luse lu butoto.»<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mbanza yi Babiloni yimwangani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, nayena mbazi yimosi yihiika yifuma ku yulu yedi kulumuka, yiba na luyaalu lulunene, mpe nkembo andi yikyenzola luse lu butoto. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Yilooka mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Yibwidi, yibwidi, mbanza yiyinene yi Babiloni! Yeka kiswamunu ki zimpeve zimbi, kiswamunu ki kadi mpeve yilembolo ba yivedila, kiswamunu ki kadi nuni yilembolo ba yivedila, kiswamunu ki kadi kibulu kilembolo ba kivedila na ki balembolo tya. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Mikangu mimvimba minwini vinu di kindumba kyandi kingolo, mu dyambu ti zintinu zii ha luse lu butoto zisidi kindumba nandi, mpe minkiti mii ha luse lu butoto mivwemi mu lulendo lu bimvwama byandi bintalu.»<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Nayuwa mu mazulu ndinga yihiika yita ti: «Duukeeno ha kati di mbanza, yeeno mukangu ani, mwanki lulembolo kota kintwadi na masumu mandi, mpe lulembolo yena mpasi ha kimosi nandi mayeela bu maamusemba. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Mu dyambu ti, masumu mandi matomini nyeka mpe matudidi natee ku mazulu, mpe Nzambi bambukidi moyo mambi mandi. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Muhidikileeno misamu bonso bu kahidikila myo bahiika, muvutudileeno nkumbu zole mambi ma kahidika. Fuluseeno nkumbu zole mbungu andi mu malamu mahyokidi ngolo na momo makanwikisa banandi. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Muvutudileeno mpasi na kyadi bifwanakani na nkembo na mayama ma bimvwama byandi bintalu. Mu dyambu ti, teedi ku nsye mutima andi ti: “Nzakadi ehaha bonso ntinu yi mukento, nidi foola ko mpe naasala kota mu kifwidi ko.” <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ni hahoho, mayeela ma ba mukubikidi, maamubwidila mu kilumbu kimosi: lufwa, kifwidi na malema, mpe waanyenga ku tiya. Mu dyambu ti, Mfumu Nzambi wumufundisi, ngolo kadi.»<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Ntinu zii ha luse lu butoto zisidi kindumba nandi na zikabudi kimvwama kyandi kikinene, zaadila na zaakota mu manyongo mu dyambu dyandi, bu zaayena mwisi wunkobo wu kana nyengina. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Zaaba kitatu, mu dyambu di bunkuta bu mpasi zandi na zaata ti: «Kyadi! Mpila kyadi! Ngeye Babiloni, mbanza yiyinene na yingolo! Mu kilokola kimosi kaka, mfundusu aku yitudidi.»<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Minkiti mii ha luse lu butoto myaadila na myaakota mu kifwidi, mu dyambu ti ku muntu ko wuna bwesa sumba bima byawu: <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Wola, kisengo kimpembe, matadi mantalu na palata, milele mintalu mi lino na milele mimbwaki na mii na ntinta yimbwaki yina lezima, milele mi swa na mabaya ma mumpila-mumpila maa mpasi mu yena, bima bi mumpila-mumpila bihiduku mu meeno ma nzawu, mu mabaya mantalu, mu nsongo, mu kisengo na mu matadi matoma lengomoka, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Bima bi mfuku yimbote bi mumpila mumpila na mananasi, mananasi ma mile, maaka mamfuku yimbote, vinu, mafuta, faline, bele, zingombe, mameme na zimpunda, makaalu ma mvita, mindongo na zinkole. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />«Mbutu yedi tyanga mwela aku, yeka kitatu naku, bima byaku bimvimba bintoko na byedi lezimanga bizimbadi, mpe kulendi bwesa bye baka ko!» <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Minkiti mivwama mu mumbungu mu mbanza beyoyo, myaatelama kukula mu dyambu di bunkuta bu mpasi zandi, myaadila na myaakota mu manyongo. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Myaata ti: «Kyadi! Mpila kyadi! Nge mbanza yiyinene yilweti milele mi lino, milele mintalu mimbwaki yina lezima, lweti misanga mi wola na mi matadi mantalu na mi palata! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu kilokola kimosi kwandi, bimvwama bimvimba bizimbadi!» Binati bimvimba bi masuwa na bisadi bi masuwa na yobobo bamvimba bakwe bakilanga luzingu lwawu mu mubu, baba batelama kitatu. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Bu bayena mwisi wedi nyenginanga mbanza, balookana ti: «Nani wuba wufwanakana na mbanza yiyinene!» <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Batuba fundu-fundu ha yulu mitu myawu, badila, banyonga mpe bedi kwe lookani ti: «Kyadi! Mpila kyadi mbanza yiyinene! Mu dyambu di kimvwama kyandi, bamvimba bebobo baa na masuwa mu mubu, bamana vwama! Kansi mu kilokola kimosi kwandi, bimvimba bebyobyo bizimbadi!»<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Nge yulu, yangalala mu mwangununu andi! Yeeno mpe bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi, zintumwa na mimbikudi, yangalaleeno mu dyambu ti Nzambi wumufundisi mu misamu mimbi mikaluhidikidi.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Buna, mbazi yimosi yilulendo yibonga tadi dimosi difwanakani na tadi didinene di bakwe nikinanga mbutu, wulosa dyo mu mubu na wuta ti: «Ni bwabobo mpe Babiloni, mbanza yiyinene baabwisila yo mu ngolo, mpe yaabwesa yenika dyaka ko. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Ku ngeye, kwaabwesa yuwakana dyaka muningu wu bisiki bi lungoyingoyi na minyimbidi ko, muningu wu bisiki bi matuutu hoti kulumenta ko. Ku ngeye, kwaabwesa ba muntu wuzebi kadi kisalu ko, mpe kwaabwesa yuwakana lusuku lu tadi di bakwe nikinanga ko. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Kukya ku mwinda kwaabwesa lezima ko, mpe kwaabwesa yuwakana ndinga yi mukento na bakala bakwelani ko, mu dyambu ti minkiti myaku miba bantu bazangama ha luse lu butoto, mpe mu dyambu ti , zihukumuni bantu ba nsi zimvimba.»<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ku ngeye, bayena menga ma mimbikudi, ma bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na ma bamvimba bebobo babahonda ha luse lu butoto.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yina kembila Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ku manima ma misamu bemyomyo, nayuwa ku yulu, bonso ndinga yingolo yi mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu yita ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">«Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Bika mpulusu, nkembo na lulendo luba ku Nzambi eto!<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Mu dyambu ti mfundusu zandi zikedika na zilunungu zidi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Fundisi mukento wu kindumba kihyokidi kitezo wedi hunanga mu kindumba kyandi luse lu butoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">mpe wumusemba mu menga makatengola ma bisadi byandi.»<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Nkumbu yizole bata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">«Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Mwisi wu mbanza yiyinene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">yi bayokidi wuna tomboka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">ku yulu mimvu ka mimvu!»<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Binunu makumole na biya na bihangu biya bimoyo, bafukama na basambila Nzambi wuu wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu, bata ti: «Ameni! Aleluya!»<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyese ku bantu babatumisi ku makwela ma Mwana Dimeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ndinga yimosi yiyuwakana ha kyandu ki kintinu, yita ti: «Kembileeno Nzambi eto, yeno bamvimba bisadi byandi, yeeno lukwe muzitisanga, bantu bamfunu na ba bakwe tyakanga!» <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Nayuwa bonso ndinga yi mpumbu yi bantu yiyinene, yifwanakana bonso lusuku lu mamba mamanene, mpe bonso lusuku lu mimbamina mingolo, yita ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">«Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Mu dyambu ti Mfumu Nzambi eto, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">yenikisi luyaalu lwandi.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tuyangalaleeno, tudunzumukeeno</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">na tumuhaaneeno nkembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">mu dyambu ti makwela ma Mwana Dimeme matudidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">mukento andi mpe wukubamani.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Bamuheeni kalwata mulele wuntalu wu lino, wuna lezima na wuvedila.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">Mu dyambu ti mulele wuntalu wu lino, ni mavanga malunungu ma bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Mbazi yimosi yinteela ti: «Sonika: Kyese ku yobobo babatumisi ku ndambisa yi makwela ma Mwana Dimeme.» Yita dyaka ti: «Mo ni mambu makedika ma Nzambi.»<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ni nabwa ha malu mandi mu musambila, kansi wunteela ti: «Kusandi bobo! Meno mukundi aku wu kisalu nidi na wu zimpangi zaku zii zikwikama mu kimbangi ki Yesu. Nzambi kaka fweti sambila! Mu dyambu ti, ni kimbangi ki Yesu kidi mbikudulu yi kimpeve.»<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinati ki mpunda ha yulu mpunda yimpembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Mboki nayena mazulu mazibuka na mpunda yimosi yimpembe yiyenika. Yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu andi, nkumbu andi Kwikama na Kedika, kwe fundisanga na kwe nwananga mvita mu lunungu. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Meso mandi maa bonso tiya tuna pyala milaka, ha yulu mutu andi, mpu zizingi zi kintinu ziba hoho. Yandi wuba na nkumbu yisonama yilembolo zaba muntu tala ti ka yandi bende kaka ko. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Wulwata kiyunga kibavwengi mu menga, mpe nkumbu andi «Mambu ma Nzambi.» <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mpumbu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi mazulu, yedi kwe mulandi mu yulu zimpunda zimpembe, yiba yilwata milele mintalu mi lino mimpembe na mivedila. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mu munwa andi muduuka mbele yimeeno yiyila yi kaasembila zinsi. Yandi waaba munkengi awu na muhangu wukisengo ha kooko, yandi waakamuna mbutu zi vinu mu kikamununu ki nganzi zi Nzambi, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ha yulu kiyunga kyandi na ha yulu bunda dyandi, nkumbu yimosi yisonama ti: «Ntinu yi zintinu na Mfumu yi zimfumu».<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Nayena mbazi yitelama ha ntangu. Yilooka mu ndinga yingolo na yita ku zinuni zimvimba, zedi kwe pidumuki ha kati-kati di yulu ti: «Yizeeno na yonzameeno mu dyambu di ndambisa yiyinene yi Nzambi! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Mwanki ludya misunya mi zintinu, mi zimfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu, mi bantu baa na lulendo, mi zimpunda na binati byawu, misunya mi bantu bamvimba baa na kimpwanza na mindongo, mpe bantu bamfunu na ba bakwe tyakanga.»<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Nayena kibulu, zintinu zii ha luse lu butoto na mpumbu yi zimbulu-mbulu zawu, yiyonzama mu nwanisa yondowo zakadi ha yulu mpunda na mpumbu andi yi zimbulu-mbulu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Babwila kibulu ha kimosi na mumbikudi wuluvunu, yondowo wuhidika ha ntadisi andi, bimangu bimuhaana hwahwa mu zimbisa yobobo batambula kidimbu ki kibulu, mpe bedi sambilanga kiteki kyandi. Babatuba bamoyo yababole mu dyanga di tiya tu sufele. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Bantu basaala, babahonda mu mbele yiyila yedi duukanga mu munwa wu yondowo wuba wuzakala ha yulu mpunda, mpe zinuni zimvimba ziyukuta misunya myawu.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Funda di mimvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Mboki, nayena mbazi yimosi yifuma ku yulu yedi kulumuka, yisimba ha kooko kwandi nsabi yi bulu dinsisi na musinga wuwunene wu kisengo. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Mbazi yisimba Ndalango na yibindika yo misinga, mwanki kaba wukangama funda di mimvu (1000). Ndalango beyoyo, ni nyoka yi ntama, yi bakwe tumisinanga ti Nkadyampemba na Satana. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Mbazi yimutuba mu bulu dinsisi. Mboki yikanga mwelo na yituula wo bikaku, mwanki Ndalango kalembolo bwesa huna mikangu natee funda di mimvu bu myahyoka. Ku manima, fweti nyangunu mu mwa ntangu yifyoti.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Nayena byandu bi kintinu. Yobobo baba bazakala momo, babahaana lulendo lwe fundisa. Nayena mpe myela mi yobobo babatabula mitu mu dyambu di kimbangi mu Yesu na mu Mambu ma Nzambi, na yobobo balembolo sambila kibulu na kiteki kyandi, mpe balembolo tambula kidimbu ha mbunzu na ha kooko kwawu. Bavutukila dyaka mu zinga na mu yaala na Klisto funda di mimvu. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Bantu bahiika bafwa, bavutukila dyaka mu zinga ko natee funda di mimvu bu dyaahwa. Yo ni mfulukulu mu bafwa yintete. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Kyese ku yobobo baafuluka mu mfulukulu yintete mu bafwa! Badi bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na lufwa lunzole lusidi dyaka na lulendo mu yawu ko. Baaba zinganga-Nzambi zi Nzambi na zi Klisto, mpe baayaala ha kimosi na Klisto funda di mimvu.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkadyampemba bedoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Funda di mimvu bu dyaahwa, Satana baamuduukisa mu boloko dyandi, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />na mbo kenda kahuna Ngonge na Mangonge, ni zinsi zii ku ndambusu ziya zi nza. Mbo kabayonzika mu nwana mvita, mpe mbo baba babingi bonso munyenge wu kumu di mubu. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Bamwangana ha luse lu butoto lumvimba, ni bazunga kifulu ki bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi na mbanza yizola yi Nzambi. Kansi, tiya tufuma ku yulu, tukulumuka na tubanyengisa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Nkadyampemba wedi bahunanga, bamutuba mu dyanga di tiya tu sufele, mo mudi kibulu na mumbikudi wuluvunu. Baakwamusu momo mpimpa na mwini, mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfundusu yimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Mboki, nayena kyandu kikinene kimpembe ki kintinu na yondowo wuba wuzakala hoho. Mazulu na butoto bitina ha ntadisi andi, mpe bibwesa yenika dyaka ko. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Nayena bantu bafwa, bantu bamfunu na ba bakwe tyakanga, batelama ha ntadisi yi kyandu ki kintinu. Mabuuku mazibulu. Buuku dihiika dizubulu, ni buuku di luzingu. Bantu bafwa bafundusu bonso bubela mavanga mawu, mpe bonso buwusonama mu mabuuku. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Mubu wuvutula bantu bafwa baba mu kati dyandi, lufwa na nsi yi bafwa bavutula mpe bantu bafwa baba ku yawu. Kadi muntu wufundusu bonso bubela mavanga mandi. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Batuba lufwa na nsi yi bafwa mu dyanga di tiya. Dyanga di tiya ni lufwa lunzole. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Wonso muntu walembolo yena nkumbu andi yisonama mu buuku di luzingu, watubu mu dyanga di tiya.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yulu dimoona na butoto bumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Bwabu nayena yulu dimoona na butoto bumoona, mu dyambu ti yulu dintete na butoto buntete bizimbala, na mubu wuba dyaka ko. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nayena mbanza yilongo, Yelusalemi yimoona yifuma ku mazulu, yifidusu ku Nzambi, yikubama bonso mukento wukwela wutomisi nitu andi mu dyambu di mulumi andi. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Nayuwa ndinga yingolo yiduuka ha kyandu ki kintinu, yita ti: «Tala, bwabu Nzambi zakadi ha kati-kati di bantu! Waazakala ha kimosi nawu, mpe baaba bantu bandi. Nzambi yandi bende waaba nawu, mpe waaba Nzambi awu. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Mbo kakusuna manswela mamvimba ma meso mawu. Lufwa lwaabwesa ba ko, kwaabwesa ba kifwidi ko, milooko ko na mpasi ko, mu dyambu ti bima bintete bizimbadi.»<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Yondowo wuba wuzakala ha kyandu ki kintinu wuta ti: «Nsidi bwabu bima bimvimba bimoona.» Mboki wunteela ti: «Sonika, mu dyambu ti mpova zani zikedika na zikwikama zidi.»<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Wubwesa ta ti: «Bulungidi! Meno nidi alafa na omega, mbadukulu na nsukunu. Yondowo wuu na mpwila, mbo namuhaana mamba mampamba ma nto yi luzingu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Wonso muntu waanunga, waatambula kuu meno fwa bedyodyo, naaba Nzambi andi, mpe yandi waaba mwana ani. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Kansi ku bantu baa na bunkuta, bakwe lembolo kwikilanga, baa na bifu nkatika bimbi, mimpondi, bakwe sadilanga kindumba, zindoki, bakwe sambilanga biteki na bantu bamvimba baa na luvunu, dyanga di tiya tu sufele dyaaba ni musendo awu: lo ni lufwa lunzole.»<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yelusalemi yimoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Mboki, yimosi mu zimbazi nsambwadi wusimba mbungu nsambwadi zifuluka mu mayeela nsambwadi mamanunu, wuyiza zonza naani. Wunteela ti: «Yiza, mbo nakulonka mukento wukwela, mukazi wu Mwana dimeme.»<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Mpeve yi ndwata na mbazi yintwadisa ha nsongi yi mulandu wutoma zangama, ni kandonka mbanza yilongo, Yelusalemi yifuma ku mazulu, yifidusu ku Nzambi, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />mpe yifuluka mu nkembo wu Nzambi. Mbanza yedi lezima bonso tadi dintalu, tadi di zape dii bonso tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Yiba yizungudulu mu bibaka bibinene na bizangama, mpe ha myelo kumi na myole haba na mbazi kumi na zole. Ha yulu myelo bemyomyo, basonika nkumbu zi bifumba kumi na byole bi bisi-Isaeli: <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />ku esete myelo mitatu, ku node myelo mitatu, ku sude myelo mitatu na ku wesete myelo mitatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Bibaka bi mbanza biba bitungu mu matadi kumi na mole mu lufulu. Mu lufulu belolo, musonama nkumbu zi zintumwa kumi na zole zi Mwana Dimeme.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Yondowo wedi zonzanga naani, wuba na kitezolo, dyadya dimosi di wola dye tezila mbanza na myelo myandi, mpe na bibaka byandi. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Mbanza yiba na bibaka biya, bula na bukufi bwandi buba kitezo kimosi. Mbazi wuteza mbanza mu dyadya dyandi: wubaka mafunda kumi na mole (12000) ma zimetele mu bula, mu bukufi na mu kuzangama. Biba bimvimba kitezo kimosi. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Wuteza bibaka: wutanga makuminsambwadi na zole (72) yi zi metele<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makuminsambwadi na zole (72) yi zi metele</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Mu Kingeleke basonikini ti zikude nkama mosi makumaya na ya (144), kude yidi bula bu kooko kutonina mu milembo natee ku konzo di kooko.</char></note>, mpe kitezolo kikwe sadilanga mbazi kiba bonso kitezolo kikwe sadilanga muntu. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Bibaka biba bitungu mu matadi ma zape, mpe mbanza yawu bende yiba yitungu mu wola divedila, yiba nakyenzikyenzi bonso tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Lufulu lu bibaka bi mbanza, batomilo mu matadi mantalu ma mumpila-mumpila: lufulu luntete lutungu mu matadi ma zape, lunzole mu matadi ma safile, lutatu mu matadi ma kalasedoni, luya mu matadi ma emelode, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />lutanu mu matadi ma saladoni, lusambanu mu matadi ma saladwani, lunsambwadi mu matadi ma klisolite, lunana mu matadi ma belili, luvwa mu matadi ma topazi, lukumi mu matadi ma klisopalasi, lukumi na mosi mu matadi ma yasinte, lukumi na zole mu matadi ma ametisite. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Myelo kumi na myole miba, ni palata kumi na zole, kadi mwelo wuba wuhiduku mu palata dimosi kaka. Nzila yiyinene yi mbanza yihiduku mu wola divedila, yiba napekipeki bonso tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Kansi, nayena nzo-Nzambi mu mbanza beyoyo ko, mu dyambu ti nzo-Nzambi andi ni Nzambi, Mfumu yi lulendo lumvimba na Mwana dimeme. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Mbanza yii na nsatu yi ntangu ko, yi ngonda ko mu kyenzola yo, mu dyambu ti nkembo wu Nzambi wuna kyenzola yo, mpe Mwana dimeme ni mwinda andi. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Zinsi zaadyata mu kya kwandi, mpe zintinu zii ha luse lu butoto zaamunatina bimvwama byawu. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Myelo myandi myaakangama mu mwini ko, mu dyambu ti mpimpa yaabwesa ba hoho ko. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Baanata kuuna nkembo na nzitusu yi zinsi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Mwaakota nakani kima ki busafu ko, kani muntu kwe sadilanga bifu bi nkatika bimbi hoti bi luvunu ko, kansi ni yobobo kaka badi na nkumbu zisonama mu buuku di luzingu di Mwana dimeme.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Mboki, mbazi yindonka nzadi yii na mamba ma luzingu, maa nakyenzikyenzi bonso tadi dikwe yenikisanga bima bii ku kinima, mpe medi duukanga ha kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi na Mwana dimeme, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />mpe nzadi yedi kumbanga ha kati-kati di nzila yiyinene yi mbanza. Mu kadi kumu di nzadi, kuba na muti wu luzingu, wukwe butanga mbutu nkumbu kumi na zole (12) mu mumvu, mpe nkumbu yimosi mu kadi ngonda. Makaya ma muti makwe sadulungu mu nyakisa bantu baa mu zinsi. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kwaabwesa ba nsingulu ko. Kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi na ki Mwana Dimeme, kyaaba mu mbanza, mpe bisadi byandi byaamusambila.<verse eid="REV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Baayena kiini kyandi, mpe nkumbu andi yaaba yisonama ha mbunzu zawu. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Mpimpa yaabwesa ba ko, mpe baabwesa ba na nsatu yi kya ku mwinda na ku ntangu ko, mu dyambu ti Mfumu Nzambi waabakyenzola. Mpe baayaala mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyizulu mu muswalu yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Mboki mbazi yinteela ti: «Mpova bezizi, zikedika na zikwikama zidi, Mfumu Nzambi yikwe sadilanga mu mpeve mimbikudi, tambikidi mbazi andi mu lonka ku bisadi byandi misamu myaakwiza mu muswalu.»<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />«Tala, nina kwiza mu muswalu. Kyese ku yondowo wuna keba mpova zi mbikudulu zi buuku bedidi!»<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Meno ni Yoane, yondowo wuyuwa na wuyena misamu bemyomyo. Bu nayuwa na bu nayena myo, nabwa ha malu ma mbazi wundonka myo, mwanki namusambila. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Kansi wunteela ti: «Kusandi bobo! Mukundi aku wu kisalu nidi na wu zimpangi zaku mimbikudi, mpe na yobobo bamvimba bakwe kebanga mambu ma buuku bedidi. Ni Nzambi fweti sambila!»<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Mboki wubwesa ta dyaka ti: «Kuswekandi mpova zimbikudulu zi buuku bedidi, mu dyambu ti ntangu yeka bela-bela <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Yondowo wudi wumbi, bika katatamana mu ba wumbi, yondowo wusumuka katatamana mu ba wusumuka, yondowo wudi wulunungu, katatamana mu ba wulunungu, mpe yondowo wudi wulongo, katatamana mu ba wulongo.»<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />«Tala, nina kwiza mu nswalu, mufutu ani wuna kwiza ha kimosi naani, mwanki nasenda kadi muntu bonso budi mavanga mandi. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Meno nidi Alafa na Omega, wuntete na wumanunu, mbadukulu na nsukunu.»<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Kyese ku yobobo basukudi mazwele mawu mamala, mwanki baba na luve mu dya mbutu zi muti wu luzingu<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2:7">2.7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Mba 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3.22</ref></char> </note> na mu kota mu myelo mu mbanza. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Kansi ku mbazi yi mbanza, kuu na zimbwa, zindoki, bakwe sadilanga kindumba, mimpondi, bakwe sambilanga biteki na bantu bakwe tyanga luvunu na bakwe sadilanga luvunu!<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Meno Yesu, ntambikidi mbazi ani mwanki kaluteela kimbangi mu misamu mitadidi Mabundu. Meno nidi mwanzi na kinama mu nkuna yi Davidi, mpe lubwetete lukwe lezimanga mu mene.<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Mpeve na mukento wukwela bateedi ti: «Yiza!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Bika yondowo wuna yuwa kata ti: «Yiza!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Bika yondowo wuu na mpwila kiza, bika yondowo tiidi mamba ma luzingu, kabonga mo mampamba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Yes 55.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misamu mimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Meno nina ta kimbangi ku kadi muntu wuna yuwa mpova zi mbikudulu di buuku bedidi: tala ti muntu bwesidi mwa mpova momo, Nzambi waamubwesa mayeela ma basonikini mu buuku bedidi. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Mpe tala ti muntu katudi mpova zi mbikudulu zi buuku bedidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Mis 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:1">13.1</ref></char></note>, Nzambi waakatula kikunku kyandi mu mbutu zi muti wu luzingu na mu mbanza yilongo bonso bu wudi wusonama mu buuku bedidi.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yondowo wuna ta kimbangi ki misamu bemyomyo, teedi ti: «Ninga, nina kwiza mu muswalu!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni! Mfumu Yesu, yiza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Taleeno mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:22">1 Ko 16.22</ref></char></note>!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Bika Mfumu eto Yesu-KListo kalusakumuna yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>